    "about": "Origami Finance is an automated leveraged farming protocol on Ethereum, Berachain, and Plasma that allows users to deposit assets into Tokenised Balance Sheet (TBS) vaults and receive amplified yield exposure through one-click 'folding' — recursively borrowing against collateral from third-party lenders (Morpho, Spark, Euler). The protocol's lov-Strategy vaults (e.g. lovSUSDe, lovWSTETH, lovOriBGT) manage leverage ratios automatically via smart rebalancing, minimising liquidation risk without requiring users to monitor health factors. On Berachain, Origami operates auto-staking and auto-compounding vaults for Infrared LP positions. A single Gnosis Safe multisig (0x781B4c57100738095222bd92D37B07ed034AB696) owns all protocol contracts and collects fees."
